		)
		(uuid "7c78914a-ef88-550f-a180-20baf56d86e0")
	)
	(text "RT601 limits the pendant supply to 0.25 A hold. PSM712 clamps each line pair (-7 V / +12 V). The 120 R terminations are not fitted."
